# Home and Nav Category Display

## Header (desktop + mobile menu)

Shows **all main categories** with no filter: `useProductCategories({ mainOnly: true })`.

## Homepage carousel and bottom nav sheet (دسته بندی ها)

Use **Featured** first, then fall back to **name filter**:

- **Strapi**: Product Category has a **featured** boolean. In Strapi Admin → Product Categories, check "Featured" on categories that should appear in the homepage carousel and in the bottom nav category sheet.
- **Frontend**: `getProductCategories({ mainOnly: true, featuredOnly: true, allowedNameSubstrings: ALLOWED_HOME_NAV_CATEGORY_NAME_SUBSTRINGS })` and `useProductCategories({ mainOnly: true, featuredOnly: true, allowedNameSubstrings: ALLOWED_HOME_NAV_CATEGORY_NAME_SUBSTRINGS })`. The service returns featured categories when any exist; if none are featured, it filters by `allowedNameSubstrings` (مانتو, پلیور, دامن, etc.) so something always shows.

## Name filter constant

- [frontend/src/constants/categories.ts](mdc:frontend/src/constants/categories.ts) exports `ALLOWED_HOME_NAV_CATEGORY_NAME_SUBSTRINGS` (includes مانتو, پلیور, دامن, کت, …). Used only as fallback when no categories are marked featured.
